\sqrt{2}}\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\n- For ${\\lambda }_{3}=-1,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A-(-1)I & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 2\\end{bmatrix}-(-1)\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 3 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 3\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSeeking a non-zero solution of $(A-(-1)I)x=0$ gives the eigenvector ${v}_{3}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}.$ Dividing ${v}_{3}$ by its norm $‖{v}_{3}‖=1,$ we get \n\n$$\n\\frac{{v}_{3}}{‖{v}_{3}‖}=\\frac{1}{1}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nFinally, we construct the orthogonal matrix $P$ in the usual way, and this gives us the following:\n\n$$\nP=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 & 1 \\\\ \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} & -\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} & 0 \\\\ \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} & \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} & 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186395003 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "74508bdf-f140-5808-9753-25533e49826f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} & 0 & -\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} & 0 & \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186395005} {:answer/id #uuid "fda3000f-f50a-5453-b611-d8cc82671b33" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}0 & \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} & -\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{5}} \\\\ 0 & \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} & \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}} \\\\ 1 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186395006} {:answer/id #uuid "b2cb2171-7767-503d-acc5-5ef3cf65216f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} & 0 & \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} & 0 & \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186395007} {:answer/id #uuid "34171141-8b0b-51c6-a150-b276b6fadb51" :answer/type {:db/id