(k)$ given that\n$v=\\begin{bmatrix}-5 \\\\ 2+4\\text{i}\\end{bmatrix}$\nand\n$\\overset{―}{kv}=\\begin{bmatrix}-5-10\\text{i} \\\\ 10\\end{bmatrix}.$" :question/worked-solution "Since $\\overset{―}{kv}=\\overset{―}{k}\\,\\overset{―}{v},$ we get the following equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{―}{kv} & =\\overset{―}{k}\\,\\overset{―}{v} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}-5-10\\text{i} \\\\ 10\\end{bmatrix} & =\\overset{―}{k}\\,\\overset{―}{\\begin{bmatrix}-5 \\\\ 2+4\\text{i}\\end{bmatrix}} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}-5-10\\text{i} \\\\ 10\\end{bmatrix} & =\\overset{―}{k}\\,\\begin{bmatrix}\\overset{―}{-5} \\\\ \\overset{―}{2+4\\text{i}}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}-5-10\\text{i} \\\\ 10\\end{bmatrix} & =\\overset{―}{k}\\,\\begin{bmatrix}-5 \\\\ 2-4\\text{i}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}-5-10\\text{i} \\\\ 10\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}-5\\overset{―}{k} \\\\ (2-4\\text{i})\\overset{―}{k}\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we obtain the system\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}-5\\overset{―}{k} &=-5-10\\text{i} \\\\ (2-4\\text{i})\\overset{―}{k} &=10.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nFrom the first equation, we get \n\n$$\n\\overset{―}{k}=1+2\\text{i}.\n$$\n\nSubstituting this into the second equation, we obtain the true statement\n\n$$\n(2-4\\text{i})(1+2\\text{i})=10.\n$$\n\nTherefore, $k=\\overset{―}{1+2\\text{i}}=1-2\\text{i}.$\n\nFinally, $\\text{Re}(k)=1.$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186266003 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "754bcc8c-0473-5c5c-9bf5-eaa6d47f462f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186264020} {:answer/id #uuid "973a8d6a-66b6-59a4-b8d7-309c2279acd1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186264296} {:answer/id #uuid "b04cca1c-536c-5d1e-a270-4629002bad15" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186264520} {:answer/id #uuid "c257d33a-3b27-5109-8151-065f889560ff" :answer/type {:db/