$$\n\nTherefore, $k=\\overset{―}{6-6\\text{i}}=6+6\\text{i}.$\n\nFinally, $\\text{Re}(k)=6.$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186266004 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "32514227-9785-5a79-a961-98eb7f787c9d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186263431} {:answer/id #uuid "71eb320a-6957-560d-90d0-eb4653320ee0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "8" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186263986} {:answer/id #uuid "be9e9f12-87d9-5cdf-b828-d1172a246096" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186264656} {:answer/id #uuid "c4134131-c95b-5609-8403-11656dcef621" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186264713} {:answer/id #uuid "fe0fd637-6093-5d9d-9a79-ebdf38f0ce24" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186265237}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186263431} :answer-field/id #uuid "2040ef8a-776a-5a0d-b248-95e933ab98b8" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186265299}] :question/id #uuid "efbde7ce-c5dc-58bb-af77-efbf61eef9d8" :question/math-academy-id "q-130894" :question/problem "Find $\\text{Re}(k)$ given that\n$v=\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ -5-\\text{i}\\end{bmatrix}$\nand\n$\\overset{―}{kv}=\\begin{bmatrix}-20+28\\text{i} \\\\ 18-40\\text{i}\\end{bmatrix}.$" :question/worked-solution "Since $\\overset{―}{kv}=\\overset{―}{v},$ we get the following equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{―}{kv} & =\\overset{―}{k}\\,\\overset{―}{v} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}-20+28\\text{i} \\\\ 18-40\\text{i}\\end{bmatrix} & =\\overset{―}{k}\\,\\overset{―}{\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ -5-\\text{i}\\end{bmatrix}} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}-20+28\\text{i} \\\\ 18-40\\text{i}\\end{bmatrix} & =\\overset{―}{k}\\,\\begin{bmatrix}\\overset{―}{4} \\\\ \\overset{―}{-5-\\text{i}}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}-20+28\\text{i} \\\\ 18-40\\text{i}\\end{bmatrix} & =\\overset{―}{k}\\,\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ -5+\\text{i}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}-20+28\\text{i} \\\\ 18-40\\text{i}\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}4\\overset{―}{k} \\\\ (-5+\\text{i})\\overset{―}{k}\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we obtain the system\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}4\\overset{―}{k} &=-20+28\\text{i} \\\\ (-5+\\text{i})\\overset{―}{k} &=18-40\\text{i}.\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nFrom the first equation, we get\n\n$$\n\\overset{―}{k}=-5+7\\text{i}\n$$\n\nSubstituting this into the second equation, we obtain the true statement\n\n$$\n(-5+\\text{i})(-5+7\\text{i})=18-40\\text{i}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $k=\\overset{―}{-5+7\\text{i}}=-5-7\\text{i}.$\n\nFinally, $\\text{Re}(k)=-5.$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186266005 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5ad0b27e-4709-56c3-980d-5e89b24b64e4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186263783} {:answer/id #uuid "5c7235f7-ec5e-57c5-81ef-ac4045f503db" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186263798} {:answer/id #uuid "82179f20-b4ad-54b1-ac7a-5d36de6b7cc1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186264118} {:answer/id #uuid "f2bf7db3-7480-525a-a692-5640d4ed8b91" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186265133} {:answer/id #uuid "fb4cabae-b730-5eb9-bc16-761e74a9a281" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186265202}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186265202} :answer-field/id #uuid "726ece7e-7cf9-57dd-b337-dbff14077d4f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186265441}] :question/id #uuid "39972902-c596-5398-be7d-e6e7c